blueline: SoC temperatures for thermalmonitord (bluethermal=1)

BlueThermal on IOResources makes one HID temperature service (0xFF00, 0x05) per
sensor name in D22AP-Info.plist that SDM845 TSENS can stand for (Gold, Silver,
L3, GPU, always-on, memory, Wi-Fi, camera, video, modem); copyEvent answers
kIOHIDEventTypeTemperature with the reading (first, mean or highest).

